{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10017_01_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:ca0aeea9eeb1790a630774ee954c59d68206b50904422607475782d4b87ab902",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_c:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d52ee74acc0081f27f176ef93c914d0bce35b9b5c653107b701dd327403571d",
      "text": "广告的内容是……\n“主人公向对方倾诉凄苦的单相思”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d92851bab39fccc0de207b17f909e0e88ca08a71a158aad3f1c01cb71174ba8",
      "text": "广告和歌曲，与其说是恋爱，\n不如说是以单相思为主题啊……感觉好难啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9d71ce3a15d5330a082c4fe3088a53ecc85e05227639b43dfc6c15d57dd7a8e",
      "text": "（但是……我想试一试）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:074d0cb658e155d03f891cd4809ce29f48f4fd7df22538b4c8f014d465994bb3",
      "text": "（这段歌词，和我好像。抱着自己的心意，\n停在原地不知道该如何是好……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31373121c391457e77ee0c5f938a89c11967a392e1e9799999f52c081292e141",
      "text": "（这首歌……我想用声音把它唱出来）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b991d903a95ed2c0cec467b585e4a98763fbbf33f34cae03cafb195e428454c",
      "text": "虽然感觉很难……但我想试一试。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_c:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5f8a966350daaed7af09442ab796aab3267f25797ef771426895eb0c2ff6fe8",
      "text": "恋爱的话题……我不太擅长。\n不知道能不能做好。但是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_c:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:234660ac53a8ac472e3dce4b1066a637c28ffa9b1102ddf98678f5711929e679",
      "text": "为了……那些支持我的人。\n我想要……变得能够去完成新的尝试。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_c:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b3e27a778965083c4d2ef59237e76b66e746f521253357362d25ee17a9de669",
      "text": "……一定没问题的。\n这次也有●●●●プロデューサー在身边。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_c:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95e1c6337fd1ffb9d93f5d038a8d022fa5dfa40e65f639735bc8521cbc2bcebf",
      "text": "无论遇到多么艰难的事情，\n都一定会很有耐心地支持我们吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10017_01:1_3_10017_01_c:cmd-000113:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64f6adaa514d8b744a863abd833ced8449a8ddcea9166d30b9bb344041103da7",
      "text": "哈哈……也是呢。●●●●プロデューサー，\n不好意思，这次也拜托你了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
